MID_SCXX_01_01_m01: <EDH>
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_001: This place was known as EX-189. Deep underground,\nit is reachable only from within another facility.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_025: 
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_026: 
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_027: 
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_029: 
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_002: It has been used as a proving ground. But it was\nsealed when the machines ran riot.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_003: It is an old place, according to our records. It was\nboth built and sealed many years ago.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_004: Kunlun does not seem to be aware of it.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_005: So this threat you anticipate... Are we drawing near?
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_006: Please, have a bit more patience. And I warn you,\nthe machines may not even function anymore.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_007: Wait here and I will investigate.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_008: Hmph.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_010: I understand your desire for combat, but do not let\nit lead you astray. Stay vigilant.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_011: You're wasting your handsomeness with that\ndreadful frown.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_012: 
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_014: 
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_015: Hmmm. What's this?
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_016: An alarm? You did something, didn't you?
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_018: Not I. Though I welcome this dash of excitement,\nDietrich acted on his own.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_019: Oh, for gods' sakes! Clearly your face is the only\nthing you have going for you.
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_020: 
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_022: 
MID_SCXX_01_01_m01_023: Hm. I am not known for my patience.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m01: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m01_001: I must remain here at present. Please, {SetColor=Gold}buy me\nsome time{SetColor=Default}!
MID_SCXX_01_02_m01_002: This needs my full attention, so {SetColor=Gold}do not let\nthe enemy reach me{SetColor=Default}!
MID_SCXX_01_02_m14: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m01_004: This reliance on us speaks to a lack of discipline\nwithin your clan.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m01_005: Adds up. Alright—let's do it!
MID_SCXX_01_02_m01_006: 
MID_SCXX_01_02_m01_008: 
MID_SCXX_01_02_m01_009: I will put Answerer to each and every one.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m02: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m02_001: Tch. I was careless.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m02_002: No—I told you to keep them from me! I cannot...\nGah... That I, a human, would fall here?
MID_SCXX_01_02_m02_003: Gwaah!
MID_SCXX_01_02_m04: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m04_001: I am the queen of Saramis, not the cleaner of your\nmesses. You would do well to remember that.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m04_002: I care not for your title. Your strength, however, is\netched in my memory.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m05: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m05_001: You've caused nothing but trouble. Do you intend to\npay us back somehow?
MID_SCXX_01_02_m05_002: I am certain this is to your taste. Is that enough?
MID_SCXX_01_02_m06: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m06_001: White-Maned Demon, your fierce beauty—I would\nduel you here and now.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m06_002: I think we have more pressing things to worry about.\nCan this wait until the games?
MID_SCXX_01_02_m08: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m08_001: Really! Fabio was quite upset, you know. There\nis a right way to do things, after all.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m08_002: Do not worry. It is a common occurrence.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m08_003: That...makes me even more worried for him.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m09: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m09_001: You do well to hold them off. Do not falter!
MID_SCXX_01_02_m09_002: And they assail us again. Good! Let them come!
MID_SCXX_01_02_m10: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m10_001: I will be finished before long. Resist a bit longer...
MID_SCXX_01_02_m10_002: Will it be us or them? In either case, I will simply\ncontinue to cut.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m11: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m11_001: Well done. I have completed my work.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m11_002: So it is over.
MID_SCXX_01_02_m12: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m12_001: I shall enjoy myself!
MID_SCXX_01_02_m13: <TH>
MID_SCXX_01_02_m13_001: Trivial...
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01: <EDH>
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_001: The defense mechanism is deactivated. The threat\nis eased.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_036: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_037: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_038: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_040: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_002: It must be said that you caused us quite a lot\nof trouble.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_004: You have the gall to accuse me? It was your associate\nwho touched this off.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_005: I was going to say the same thing. If you're pointing\nfingers, point them at Dietrich.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_006: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_008: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_009: Hmm.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_010: I see. It was your fault, was it? I should have guessed.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_011: What matters is that I have completed my objective.\nI was correct in asking for your aid. Thank you.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_013: I am still unsure what your goals here were, but I\nshall consider it all a training exercise.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_014: {SetColor=Gray}He should have guessed? What kind of— How the\nhell did those two get stuck together?{SetColor=Default}
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_015: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_017: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_018: I must thank you as well, Dietrich.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_019: You triggered the defense system here, which\ndiverted it from the area where I was working.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_020: I see.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_024: Now, I shall provide you with a reward.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_025: Pearls before swine, as they once said. But I suppose\nyou will find some use for these.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_028: I detect a hint of condescension in your tone.\nNevertheless, I appreciate the gift.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_029: I won't turn it down if you're offering...and I'll just\nchoose to ignore your arrogance.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_030: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_032: 
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_033: When you are with me, it seems things go well.
MID_SCXX_01_03_m01_034: Call on me if you wish. I will be of aid.